    "details": {
      "alignment": "Unaligned",
      "type": {
        "value": "construct",
        "subtype": "automaton"
      },
      "cr": 6,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Iron Cordon Brigade packet sheet — Iron Enforcer Automaton.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/iron-legion.json</code> (entry <code>iron-enforcer-automaton</code>): Large construct (automaton), Unaligned; CR 6 (proficiency +3, to hit +8 with STR); AC 17 (cast-iron chassis), hit points 105 (10d10+50), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Iron Cordon Brigade article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>The Iron Legion's heaviest line-breaker. Standing nine feet tall and armored in inches of cold-rolled iron, the Enforcer advances through enemy barricades without slowing down, pummeling resistance into paste.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> siege brute · <strong>tier:</strong> Heavy Construct · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Magitek Automata.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/iron-legion/iron-enforcer-automaton.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 510010, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, cold iron and gunmetal grey armor, brass gears, glowing cyan star-bit conduits, flat colours, crisp shading. A massive, hulking 9-foot-tall bipedal automaton built from heavy dark iron plates and exposed brass gears. Its barrel chest houses an inner furnace with glowing orange embers behind an iron grate. Massive hydraulic piston fists with heavy iron spikes. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
